    "No direct CNS exposure record for the exact query molecule; prediction relies on analog transfer.",
    "The closest positive analog is a PET probe with modest BBB uptake rather than a quantitative therapeutic exposure endpoint.",
    "Some lower-similarity analogs are efflux substrates, but their structural similarity to the query is low."
  ],
